<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Tokyo Guide: 11 places – Meiji Shrine, Shibuya, Golden Gai &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Meiji Shrine</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning when the forest is almost empty and go to Harajuku afterwards. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>139.69963,35.67484,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Harajuku</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come on a weekday and walk along Omotesandō when you need quiet. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>139.70534,35.6687,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Shibuya Crossing</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book Shibuya Sky for sunset – the slots go fast. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>139.7005,35.6595,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Sensō-ji &amp; Asakusa</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come before 8 a.m. or after sunset when it is quieter. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>139.79553,35.7134,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Shinjuku: Golden Gai, Omoide Yokochō &amp; city-hall view</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Look at the signs on the bars and ask about the cover charge before you enter. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>139.7047,35.69399,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Tsukiji Outer Market</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come before 10 a.m. and eat at the stall, not while walking. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>139.77047,35.66539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Imperial Palace East Gardens</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Check the closing days and plan a quiet morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>139.7574,35.6867,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Nakameguro – canal, cafés &amp; cherry blossom</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come during the cherry blossom on a weekday or early in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>139.69883,35.64414,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Shimokitazawa – vintage &amp; live music</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come in the afternoon when the shops are open and stay until the evening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>139.66633,35.66168,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Yanaka – old Tokyo</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Combine Yanaka with Ueno Park and plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>139.76532,35.72767,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Akihabara – electronics, anime &amp; arcades</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the late afternoon and stay until evening when everything glows. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tokyo/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>139.77437,35.70189,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
